# Success Criteria

Every REBASH Academy lab should feel like a real engineering assignment.

Learners should solve authentic problems, validate every milestone, troubleshoot failures, understand production implications and complete the lab with the confidence to perform similar tasks in real enterprise environments.

The learner should finish the lab thinking:

"I could perform this task at work."